    "note": "Version read: House Draft 1 (HD1); the bill has a passage vote, so amendments made after HD1 are not in the text read. Some sentences in HRS 134-8(c)-(d) are mixed with struck words and are not quoted; the bill strikes the antique pistol or revolver definition."
